{"3151840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Umblight", "steam_appid": 3151840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Umblight is a first-person roguelike deckbuilder inspired by Inscryption</strong>. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a deck of shadow and light cards, merge them into powerful new forms and fight strange creatures as you descend through the corrupted underworld!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/c51fdcaa229d74a0676d6831ef4cba22.poster.avif?t=1787764868\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/c51fdcaa229d74a0676d6831ef4cba22.webm?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/c51fdcaa229d74a0676d6831ef4cba22.mp4?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Your goal?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reach the bottom of the world and end the Umblight at its source.</strong> This spreading shadow-matter corruption inverts anything it touches, turning good into evil, light into shadow and even the dead back into living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...But what happens when you go deeper? I mean, the Umblight must have come from somewhere...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/c310eb9aabf7a904da11745b88803222.poster.avif?t=1787764868\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/c310eb9aabf7a904da11745b88803222.webm?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/c310eb9aabf7a904da11745b88803222.mp4?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Play a tactical, synergy-driven card game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cards, switch polarity, block with light shields or go offensive with shadow cards. Each card in your deck has a purpose, whether it's to stop lethal attack, or to set up a powerful combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialize your deck around any given tribe, or make a mixed build to exploit multiple playstyles all at once!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/48082ade24a8058d5900186ce066f420.poster.avif?t=1787764868\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/48082ade24a8058d5900186ce066f420.webm?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/48082ade24a8058d5900186ce066f420.mp4?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore twisted worlds of the underground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in rich 3D spaces of lush forest ruins, gear-filled factories, and desolate deserts home to sacrificial cults... there's always something new to discover in these tunnels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/cddcd94e6b79b076313dc1afe39b29a4.poster.avif?t=1787764868\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/cddcd94e6b79b076313dc1afe39b29a4.webm?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/cddcd94e6b79b076313dc1afe39b29a4.mp4?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>What can you expect from Umblight?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep synergistic deckbuilding and card battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique playstyle for each tribe, and a new experiment every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disturbing, overarching storyline and secrets that connect your runs together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Umblight is a first-person roguelike deckbuilder inspired by Inscryption</strong>. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a deck of shadow and light cards, merge them into powerful new forms and fight strange creatures as you descend through the corrupted underworld!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/c51fdcaa229d74a0676d6831ef4cba22.poster.avif?t=1787764868\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/c51fdcaa229d74a0676d6831ef4cba22.webm?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/c51fdcaa229d74a0676d6831ef4cba22.mp4?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Your goal?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reach the bottom of the world and end the Umblight at its source.</strong> This spreading shadow-matter corruption inverts anything it touches, turning good into evil, light into shadow and even the dead back into living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...But what happens when you go deeper? I mean, the Umblight must have come from somewhere...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/c310eb9aabf7a904da11745b88803222.poster.avif?t=1787764868\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/c310eb9aabf7a904da11745b88803222.webm?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/c310eb9aabf7a904da11745b88803222.mp4?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Play a tactical, synergy-driven card game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cards, switch polarity, block with light shields or go offensive with shadow cards. Each card in your deck has a purpose, whether it's to stop lethal attack, or to set up a powerful combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialize your deck around any given tribe, or make a mixed build to exploit multiple playstyles all at once!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/48082ade24a8058d5900186ce066f420.poster.avif?t=1787764868\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/48082ade24a8058d5900186ce066f420.webm?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/48082ade24a8058d5900186ce066f420.mp4?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore twisted worlds of the underground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in rich 3D spaces of lush forest ruins, gear-filled factories, and desolate deserts home to sacrificial cults... there's always something new to discover in these tunnels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/cddcd94e6b79b076313dc1afe39b29a4.poster.avif?t=1787764868\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/cddcd94e6b79b076313dc1afe39b29a4.webm?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/cddcd94e6b79b076313dc1afe39b29a4.mp4?t=1787764868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>What can you expect from Umblight?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep synergistic deckbuilding and card battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique playstyle for each tribe, and a new experiment every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disturbing, overarching storyline and secrets that connect your runs together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Descend through the corrupted underworld in Umblight, a gearpunk roguelike deckbuilder about merging your cards together. Build a deck of shadow and light cards strong enough to survive, but is it enough to reach the bottom of the world?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/c9c609c0da725b8688b988b9fc12f5a9fac0a997/header.jpg?t=1787764868", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/26b27663a3b620931c43306e9844bc01f01899f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787